# santamariabouar.com: CMS project layout

Site rule for `websites/santamariabouar.com/`. It applies in addition to the global rules in `.cursor/rules/`; where they conflict, the global rules win. Paths are relative to the site folder.

- All readme files go under the `readme` folder.
- CMS project with separation of concerns between admin and public.
- All JSON data files live in the `data` folder.
- All data file locations are defined in the `data-paths` constants.
- Put all tests in the `tests` directory.
- For admin, all CSS goes in `admin/public/css/custom.css` and all JS in `admin/public/js/custom.js`.
- Across the project follow the MVC pattern: all business logic in services, request handling in controllers, and all design and presentation in views.
